{"kind": "mod", "id": 1406, "name": "Dick Marcinko - Rogue Warrior Voice Pack", "slug": "dick-marcinko-rogue-warrior-voice-pack", "teaser": "The Rogue Warrior has arrived in Tarkov on a classified mission.", "owner_name": "TurboZoroger", "downloads": 4588, "favourites": 4, "featured": false, "contains_ads": false, "contains_ai_content": false, "cheat_notice": false, "license_name": null, "guid": "com.turbozoroger.dickmarcinkovoicepack", "thumbnail_local": null, "category": "Audio", "category_id": 12, "updated_at": "2026-07-28T08:08:30.000000Z", "created_at": "2024-05-14T23:05:12.000000Z", "published_at": "2024-05-14T23:05:00.000000Z", "latest_constraint": "~4.0.12", "latest_version": "1.0.6", "has_local": false, "has_github": false, "license_link": null, "description_html": "<p>Adds the iconic voice of Richard “Dick” Marcinko, played by Mickey Rourke, from the video game <em>Rogue Warrior</em> (2009).</p>\n<p>The voice is available to both USEC and BEAR. The voice is not added to bots.</p>\n<p><strong>How to install:</strong></p>\n<p>Extract the <strong>user</strong> folder and move it to your main <strong>SPT</strong> install folder. Overwrite if prompted.</p>\n<p>Any updates to this mod can be installed the same way.</p>\n<p><strong>How to use:</strong></p>\n<p>Switch to the new character voice in the in-game Sound settings.</p>\n<p><strong>Demo:</strong></p>\n<div class=\"youtube-lite\" data-video-id=\"fWwFWOq8Aeo\" data-embed-url=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/fWwFWOq8Aeo?autoplay=1\"><img src=\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/fWwFWOq8Aeo/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"YouTube video thumbnail\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" /></div>\n<p><strong>Notes:</strong></p>\n<p>Most voice lines are found in the following phrase groups:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Mumble (F1)</li>\n<li>Fight mumble (double-tap F1)</li>\n<li>Enemy down</li>\n<li>Fire</li>\n<li>Scav</li>\n<li>Bad work</li>\n<li>Good work</li>\n<li>Ready</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Acknowledgments:</strong></p>\n<p>• <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/user/34125-grooveypenguinx/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">GrooveypenguinX</a> et al. for <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/2310/wtt-commonlib\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><strong>WTT - CommonLib</strong></a> <strong>-</strong> the framework which makes this whole thing possible.</p>\n<p>• <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/user/34125-grooveypenguinx/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">GrooveypenguinX</a> and <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/user/25630-rockahorse/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">rockahorse</a> for <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/1883-wtt-up-in-smoke\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">WTT-Up In Smoke</a> <strong>-</strong> this mod was originally based off of its server code.</p>\n<p>• <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/user/955-justnu/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">JustNU</a> for <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/567-stalker-voices/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">STALKER VOICES</a> <strong>-</strong> contains a link in the description to a Unity project for creating the proper assetbundles. I uploaded a backup of the Unity project, it’s available <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1sDYw3rXvVjxSzdaPwrVdFKMSEdkQliS6/view?usp=sharing\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">here</a>. I did <em>not</em> create the Unity project itself and can’t help troubleshoot it.</p>\n", "versions": [{"version": "1.0.0", "spt_version_constraint": "~3.8.0", "content_length": null, "downloads": 657, "published_at": "2024-05-14T23:05:12.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/1406/dick-marcinko-rogue-warrior-voice-pack/1.0.0", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": []}, {"version": "1.0.1", "spt_version_constraint": "~3.9.0", "content_length": null, "downloads": 892, "published_at": "2024-07-08T20:51:57.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/1406/dick-marcinko-rogue-warrior-voice-pack/1.0.1", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": []}, {"version": "1.0.3", "spt_version_constraint": "~3.10.0", "content_length": null, "downloads": 255, "published_at": "2025-01-04T21:42:00.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/1406/dick-marcinko-rogue-warrior-voice-pack/1.0.3", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": []}, {"version": "1.0.5", "spt_version_constraint": "~3.11.0", "content_length": null, "downloads": 947, "published_at": "2025-06-10T18:10:13.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/1406/dick-marcinko-rogue-warrior-voice-pack/1.0.5", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": []}, {"version": "1.0.6", "spt_version_constraint": "~4.0.12", "content_length": 4440951, "downloads": 1324, "published_at": "2026-03-02T19:57:00.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/1406/dick-marcinko-rogue-warrior-voice-pack/1.0.6", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "compatible", "dependencies": [{"id": 2310, "name": "WTT - CommonLib", "slug": "wtt-commonlib"}]}], "source_code_links": []}